@DigitalWallet.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5298

### 1. Get Wallet Balance
GET {{DigitalWallet.Api_HostAddress}}/wallet/balance
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Transactions
GET {{DigitalWallet.Api_HostAddress}}/wallet/transactions
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create New Transaction (Income)
POST {{DigitalWallet.Api_HostAddress}}/wallet/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salary",
  "amount": 1500.00
}

###

### 4. Create New Transaction (Expense)
POST {{DigitalWallet.Api_HostAddress}}/wallet/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Coffee",
  "amount": -3.50
}